                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Any creature within 200 feet of the cu sith that hears their Dooming Bark must attempt a @Check[will|dc:24|options:inflicts:doomed,inflicts:fleeing,inflicts:frightened] save. A creature in an area that the cu sith can't easily reach—such as a hidden burrow or enclosed building—gets a result one degree of success better than it rolled.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and immune to Dooming Bark for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}; if already frightened, the creature's frightened value increases by 1, and it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Doomed]{Doomed 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As success, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fleeing].</p>"
                },
