                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The cu sith has a Large or smaller creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] in their jaws</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The cu sith viciously shakes their prey. The cu sith makes a jaws Strike against the grabbed creature with a +2 circumstance bonus to the attack roll. If the cu sith hits, they deal jaws damage as normal, maintains their Grab, and attempts an Athletics check to [[/act disarm]] their target of anything it's holding; this attempt to Disarm neither applies nor counts toward the cu sith's multiple attack penalty. On a miss, the cu sith releases the creature.</p>"
